{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_14\">Problem 14</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 14\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a9874ea56cf8fec1bd246793224fbcfaad17ab3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> are on a circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. The tangent line at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and the secant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b1f904f7588c84f1bf636dcc52130a263caa252.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P, B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"16\" /> lying between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/2/5125d0dd9c283820eb680930167b60bf2a3d3f7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC} = 20$\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa90aae7c0d856df4471f0d087cba966ac760ef3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{PA} = 10\\sqrt {3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"21\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d0de57f8b55944ab4532ea225957cdcfff7da09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{PB}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> equals: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2d9f1f873085312e6ffce0e5cfab36af7bd6643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10\\sqrt {3} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"409\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/377291318df52e4f013ab2bf28ee82454a9e57da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PA$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> is a tangent line, angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/a/f0ad27c513a4d0196e75348d2776d7b59637bdbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OAP$\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> is a right angle. Drop a perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710fb5fa3adedd7a16739e543d846747adbe05b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> We find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/7090f86247bb5407170767af04511bce8de71076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE = EC = 10.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"128\" height=\"13\" /> \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/e/e5ea7cbb6425eb3cfd0e8b6518d0b6a19bc11f0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AR = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/1/35179cec7202c965bb5fdaeba9f97c72ffe9a547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PE = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />. We now have a system of equations.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/425eb6be1f5c44418f0947eea5e343bef27181ce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(10\\sqrt{3})^2+r^2=PR^2\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/7/617c9d83ded67ea4a34c02357f203c0c59a060bd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\sqrt{r^2-10^2})^2+PE^2=r^2-10^2+PE^2=PR^2\\]\" width=\"362\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Set them equal to each other and solve.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd9477954a9bfbcf1e4a5b973c117f1650cc3408.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(10\\sqrt{3})^2+r^2=r^2-10^2+PE^2\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/4/5a4551b657da9370dd56c2ddd74394d51b31f041.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(10\\sqrt{3})^2=-10^2+PE^2\\]\" width=\"183\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/01459f317a9b452f31fd2040b3a26523cc99b00c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[400=PE^2\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1caef441b7ba01c1c8106ccb51f1be085649f51c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[20=PE\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964e41f9f4305229d611f6c703884f582d55b583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/e/95eebc3865e03ee31b98f03113e0fef5fcb0a924.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PE = 20 - 10 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"156\" height=\"16\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~Revised by MC413551\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3